      "Home decor and design site with a lifestyle blog giving relationship, faith, style and home design and recipe ideas.",
      "A sofa that feels as good as it looks 🤍\n\nThe Madeline Sofa by Rowe Furniture blends classic design with everyday luxury. Upholstered in rich Antiqued Moss Velvet, this 71” sofa features a plush Cloud Down cushion, elegant spool legs with pewter casters, and a compact silhouette that’s perfect for a cozy living space, a bedroom or an office. It’s the kind of piece that instantly elevates a room ✨\n\nThis Quick Ship version in Antiqued Moss Velvet is available in 2–4 weeks, or you can take home our floor model while it’s available! Prefer a different look? The Madeline can also be custom-ordered in a wide variety of fabrics with a 6–8 week lead time.\n\nVisit Blue Nest Mercantile today to see it in person and let us help you create a space you’ll love! \n\nOpen 10-5\n\n#rowefurniture #greensboronc #customfurniture #bluenestmercantile"
